      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calvert%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s historic district hosts the Katy Hamman-Stricker Women's Heritage Center, a library and museum honoring the American Woman's League.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
